WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.396 --> 00:00:03.813
Unit three. Health Policy Basics!

2
00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:09.576
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.626 --> 00:00:13.791
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.841 --> 00:00:17.633
Today we learn about Health Policy Basics. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.342 --> 00:00:23.075
Health policy. Say it with me. Health policy!

6
00:00:26.607 --> 00:00:31.041
Legislation. Say it with me. Legislation!

7
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:38.566
Public funding. Say it with me. Public funding!

8
00:00:42.111 --> 00:00:46.344
Regulation. Say it with me. Regulation!

9
00:00:49.823 --> 00:00:53.956
Stakeholder. Say it with me. Stakeholder!

10
00:00:57.432 --> 00:01:01.665
Policy maker. Say it with me. Policy maker!

11
00:01:05.192 --> 00:01:10.659
Evidence-based policy. Say it with me. Evidence-based policy!

12
00:01:14.162 --> 00:01:19.462
Health system reform. Say it with me. Health system reform!

13
00:01:22.944 --> 00:01:39.189
Health policy is shaped by legislation, public funding, and regulation. A stakeholder, like a patient group or hospital, can influence a policy maker's decisions. Evidence-based policy supports meaningful health system reform.

14
00:01:39.239 --> 00:01:42.700
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:43.399 --> 00:01:48.538
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:48.588 --> 00:01:49.869
Public funding!

17
00:01:50.890 --> 00:01:56.333
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:56.383 --> 00:01:58.529
Evidence-based policy!

19
00:01:59.727 --> 00:02:11.046
Did you know? Some of the biggest public health wins, like reducing smoking rates, came from a combination of policy, education, and regulation working together.

20
00:02:11.096 --> 00:02:13.550
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:14.655 --> 00:02:23.825
Think and answer. Why is evidence important when creating health policy?

22
00:02:23.875 --> 00:02:25.025
Great answer!

23
00:02:26.010 --> 00:02:31.472
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:31.522 --> 00:02:34.373
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

